    <header class="site-header">
        <a href="index.html" class="logo">家味<span>餐厅</span></a>
        <nav>
            <a href="index.html">首页</a>
            <a href="menu.html" class="active">菜品菜单</a>
            <a href="about.html">餐厅故事</a>
            <a href="reservation.html">预订订座</a>
        </nav>
    </header>

    <div class="page-hero">
        <h1>菜品菜单</h1>
        <p>坚持每日新鲜采购，时令更换，以下为常用菜单</p>
    </div>

    <section class="section">
        <h3 class="category-title">招牌菜</h3>
        <p class="category-desc">这几道菜从开业第一天做到现在，方子没换过</p>
        <ul class="menu-list">
            <li class="menu-item">
                <div class="menu-item-left"><h4>西湖醋鱼 <span class="tag">招牌</span></h4><p>选用当日鲜活草鱼，糖醋汁酸甜适口，配姜末葱丝</p></div>
                <div class="menu-price">¥68</div>
            </li>
            <li class="menu-item">
                <div class="menu-item-left"><h4>东坡肉 <span class="tag">招牌</span></h4><p>五花肉慢炖三小时，配绍兴黄酒，入口即化</p></div>
                <div class="menu-price">¥88</div>
            </li>
            <li class="menu-item">
                <div class="menu-item-left"><h4>龙井虾仁 <span class="tag">招牌</span></h4><p>明前龙井茶入菜，河虾仁滑嫩，清雅鲜爽</p></div>
                <div class="menu-price">¥128</div>
            </li>
            <li class="menu-item">
                <div class="menu-item-left"><h4>叫花童子鸡</h4><p>荷叶、香菇、笋片入腹，黄泥包裹木炭煨烤</p></div>
                <div class="menu-price">¥108</div>
            </li>
            <li class="menu-item">
                <div class="menu-item-left"><h4>宋嫂鱼羹</h4><p>鳜鱼去骨切丝，加笋片、香菇，胡椒粉提味</p></div>
                <div class="menu-price">¥58</div>
            </li>
        </ul>

        <h3 class="category-title">时令小炒</h3>
        <p class="category-desc">根据当天菜市场的货走，每天不太一样</p>
        <ul class="menu-list">
            <li class="menu-item">
                <div class="menu-item-left"><h4>干炸响铃</h4><p>豆腐皮裹肉馅，炸至金黄酥脆，蘸椒盐或甜酱</p></div>
                <div class="menu-price">¥48</div>
            </li>
            <li class="menu-item">
                <div class="menu-item-left"><h4>油焖春笋</h4><p>取安吉当日春笋，浓油赤酱，鲜甜多汁（3-5月）</p></div>
                <div class="menu-price">¥52</div>
            </li>
            <li class="menu-item">
                <div class="menu-item-left"><h4>青椒炒肉末</h4><p>农家青椒，五花肉末，下饭神器</p></div>
                <div class="menu-price">¥38</div>
            </li>
            <li class="menu-item">
                <div class="menu-item-left"><h4>蒜蓉蒸丝瓜</h4><p>本地水丝瓜，清蒸蒜香，简单但好吃（6-9月）</p></div>
                <div class="menu-price">¥36</div>
            </li>
            <li class="menu-item">
                <div class="menu-item-left"><h4>红烧带鱼</h4><p>东海带鱼段，酱油红烧，汤汁拌饭一绝</p></div>
                <div class="menu-price">¥56</div>
            </li>
            <li class="menu-item">
                <div class="menu-item-left"><h4>雪菜毛豆炒肉丝</h4><p>自制雪菜，嫩毛豆，瘦肉丝，清爽开胃</p></div>
                <div class="menu-price">¥42</div>
            </li>
        </ul>

        <h3 class="category-title">汤品与羹</h3>
        <p class="category-desc">老火慢煲，喝得出的鲜</p>
        <ul class="menu-list">
            <li class="menu-item">
                <div class="menu-item-left"><h4>西湖莼菜汤</h4><p>太湖莼菜，鸡丝、火腿丝，滑嫩清鲜</p></div>
